OL,3,ASchools in England get extra #500m in
OL,4,Abid to avoid teachers' pay strike
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a letter to the union on Wednesday,
OL,7,Fwhich has been seen by the BBC, the
OL,8,Fgovernment said the increase would be
OL,9,Ffunded by savings in employers'
OL,10,Fcontributions to the local government
OL,11,Fpension scheme.
